# Static site + theme

- Early boot snippet sets `data-theme` from `localStorage.sd-theme` before paint
- Toggle: `data-theme-toggle` + `assets/theme-toggle.css` + `assets/theme.js`
- Light palette targets cream `#f3f1ec` / ink `#1f1b16`; dark `#141414` / `#f2f0ec`; accent orange `#ff8c00` (slightly deeper in light)
- Prefer CSS variables over hardcoded hex so both themes stay coherent
- `/interview/` highlight.js theme link id=`hljsTheme` swaps with SiteTheme
